{"reviewId": "276023870_86fGa4oBH", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2026年的现实：我们在哪？\n2023-2024年刚刚经历了一次强厄尔尼诺。\n**2025-2026年，通常会发生“反转”，进入“拉尼娜（La Niña）”状态。**\n*   **拉尼娜是什么？** 是厄尔尼诺的妹妹，效果完全相反。\n    *   风扇吹得特别猛。\n    *   亚洲/澳洲可能会有**极寒**和**洪涝**；美洲可能会**干旱**。\n*   **对2026年的影响：**\n    *   **极寒冬天：** 如果2026年冬天是拉尼娜，可能会极冷。这就需要消耗更多的煤炭、天然气取暖。 **推高能源价格。**\n    *   **种植混乱：** 这种从极热（厄尔尼诺）到极冷（拉尼娜）的快速切换，对农作物是毁灭性的打击。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "18578-18590", "abstract": "厄尔尼诺循环（2～7年）", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "276023870_86fGa4oBH", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768741162, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 366562089, "name": "囍囍", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/ibKHP1TZZeXKFmjOLJHy6fibrwyHyFkYIiazjPy6fDFzonlYd9f5dibcKibfwUZn7NcOGnbcbvXctuG0/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数"